import ../../ui/native.dl
import project_description.dl

set state to a new project state
set instance to an instance of project window with state (the address of state)
set view to a desktop view of (the address of instance) sized 840 by 600 using fonts "assets/fonts/LiberationMono-Regular.ttf" and "assets/fonts/LiberationMono-Regular.ttf"
run the address of view
close the address of view
close the address of instance
